helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id76601				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Creates a chart in the current document. To use a continuous range of cells as the data source for your chart, click inside the cell range, and then choose this command. Alternatively, select some cells and choose this command to create a chart of the selected cells.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
