helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200911433835				0	sh	The Formatting Bar is shown when a chart is set to edit mode. Double-click a chart to enter edit mode. Click outside the chart to leave edit mode.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200911433878				0	sh	You can edit the formatting of a chart using the controls and icons on the Formatting Bar.				20181231 09:50:43
