helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200902300479				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the element from the chart that you want to format. The element gets selected in the chart preview. Click Format Selection to open the properties dialog for the selected element.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
