helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	sh	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any numeric or string expression that you want to test. If the expression can be converted to a date, the function returns \<emph\>True\</emph\>, otherwise the function returns \<emph\>False\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
