helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	sh	Use the GoTo statement to instruct $[officename] Basic to continue program execution at another place within the procedure. The position must be indicated by a label. To set a label, assign a name, and then and end it with a colon (":").				20181231 09:50:43
