helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	sh	The \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\> statement executes a loop as long as, or until, a certain condition is True. The condition for exiting the loop must be entered following either the \<emph\>Do\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Loop\</emph\> statement. The following examples are valid combinations:				20181231 09:50:43
