helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596	9			0	sh	This function is the opposite of the \<emph\>DateSerial \</emph\>function, and returns the year of a serial date. For example, the expression:				20181231 09:50:43
