helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311				0	sh	Declares a variable or an array at the procedure level within a subroutine or a function, so that the values of the variable or the array are retained after exiting the subroutine or function. Dim statement conventions are also valid.				20181231 09:50:43
