helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159156				0	sh	\<emph\>Double:\</emph\> Double floating point variable (1.79769313486232x10E308 - 4.94065645841247x10E-324)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148616				0	sh	\<emph\>Integer:\</emph\> Integer variable (-32768 - 32767)				20181231 09:50:43
