helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	sh	When testing for equivalence between Boolean expressions, the result is \<emph\>True\</emph\> if both expressions are either \<emph\>True\</emph\> or \<emph\>False\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
