helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156344				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030102.xhp\" name=\"DateValue Function [Runtime]\"\>DateValue Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150542				0	sh	Returns a date value from a date string. The date string is a complete date in a single numeric value. You can also use this serial number to determine the difference between two dates.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148799				0	sh	Syntax:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	sh	DateValue [(date)]				20181231 09:50:43
