helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	sh	A logical Exclusive-Or conjunction of two Boolean expressions returns the value True only if both expressions are different from each other.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153770				0	sh	A bitwise Exclusive-Or conjunction returns a bit if the corresponding bit is set in only one of the two expressions.				20181231 09:50:43
