helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154186				0	sh	Creates a Basic Uno object that represents a Uno dialog control during Basic runtime.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153750				0	sh	Dialogs are defined in the dialog libraries. To display a dialog, a "live" dialog must be created from the library.				20181231 09:50:43
