helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	sh	End Sub				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145642				0	sh	Sub ContListener_elementReplaced( oEvent )				20181231 09:50:43
