helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156056				0	sh	You do not need to include the parameter of an event object if the object is not used:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150042				0	sh	' Minimal implementation of Sub disposing				20181231 09:50:43
