helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080302.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148685				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03080302.xhp\" name=\"Rnd Function [Runtime]\"\>Rnd Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080302.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	sh	Returns a random number between 0 and 1.				20181231 09:50:43
