helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\callouts.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click an icon from the Callouts toolbar, then drag in the document to draw the shape.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\callouts.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	sh	Some shapes have a special handle which you can drag to change properties of the shape. The mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol over these special handles.				20181231 09:50:43
