helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	sh	Edit Data				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149388				0	sh	Editing Databases in Networks				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	sh	To make changes in a database used by more than one person, you must have the appropriate access rights. When you edit an external database, there is no intermediate storage by $[officename] of the changes made. They are sent directly to the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170800.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Table Element Wizard				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150620				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170800.xhp\" name=\"Table Element Wizard\"\>Table Element Wizard\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155354				0	sh	If you insert a table control in a document, the \<emph\>Table Element Wizard\</emph\> starts automatically. In this wizard, you can interactively specify which information is displayed in the table control.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154422				0	sh	You can use the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01171100.xhp\" name=\"Wizards On/Off\"\>\<emph\>Wizards On/Off\</emph\>\</link\> icon to keep the wizard from starting automatically.				20181231 09:50:43
