helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147588				0	sh	\<variable id=\"suchentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RecSearch\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches database tables and forms.\</ahelp\>In forms or database tables, you can search through data fields, list boxes, and check boxes for specific values. \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149355				0	sh	When searching a table, the data fields of the current table are searched. When searching in a form, the data fields of the table linked with the form are searched.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	sh	The search described here is carried out by \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>. If you want to use the SQL server to search in a database, then you should use the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12110000.xhp\" name=\"Form-based Filters\"\>Form-based Filters\</link\> icon on the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Form Bar\"\>Form Bar\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095				0	sh	The search function is also available for table controls. When calling the search function from a table control, you can search each column of the table control corresponding to the database columns of the linked database table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143267				0	sh	Search for				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	sh	Specifies the type of search.				20181231 09:50:43
