helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NumericField\"\>Creates a numerical field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the numerical values in the form can be adopted from the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153612				0	sh	Currency Field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145324				0	sh	\<image id=\"img_id3152866\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_currencyfield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152866\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145115				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CurrencyField\"\>Creates a currency field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the currency field contents for in the form can be adopted from the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148825				0	sh	Pattern Field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149742				0	sh	\<image id=\"img_id3148924\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertpatternfield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148924\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150122				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PatternField\"\>Creates a pattern field.\</ahelp\> Pattern fields consist of an edit mask and a literal mask. The edit mask determines which data can be entered. The literal mask determines the contents of the pattern field when loading the form.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152947				0	sh	Please note that pattern fields are not exported into HTML format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145147				0	sh	Group Box				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159334				0	sh	\<image id=\"img_id3153790\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_groupbox.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153790\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154572				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GroupBox\"\>Creates a frame to visually group several controls.\</ahelp\> Group boxes allow you to group option buttons in a frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148394				0	sh	If you insert a group frame into the document, the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01120000.xhp\" name=\"Group Element Wizard\"\>Group Element Wizard\</link\> starts, which allows you to easily create an option group.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150567				0	sh	\<emph\>Note:\</emph\> When you drag a group box over already existing controls and then want to select a control, you have to first open the context menu of the group box and choose \<emph\>Arrange - Send to Back\</emph\>. Then select the control while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145615				0	sh	Group boxes are used only for a visual effect. A functional grouping of option fields can be made through the name definition: under the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Name\"\>\<emph\>Name\</emph\>\</link\> properties of all option fields, enter the same name in order to group them.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157996				0	sh	Table Control				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156402				0	sh	\<image id=\"img_id3146324\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_grid.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146324\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154579				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a table control to display a database table.\</ahelp\> If you create a new table control, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170800.xhp\" name=\"Table Element Wizard\"\>Table Element Wizard\</link\> appears.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154697				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170004.xhp\" name=\"Special Information about Table Controls\"\>Special information about Table Controls\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B1E				0	sh	Navigation bar				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B2C				0	sh	\<image id=\"img_id5074922\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_navigationbar.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5074922\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B3D				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NAVIGATIONBAR\"\>Creates a navigation bar.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11DB1				0	sh	The navigation bar allows you to move through the records of a database or a database form. The controls on this navigation bar work the same way as the controls on the default \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\"\>navigation bar\</link\> in $[officename].				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146815				0	sh	Automatic Control Focus				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150261				0	sh	\<image id=\"img_id3149351\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_autocontrolfocus.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149351\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109848	137			0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoControlFocus\"\>If\<emph\> Automatic Control Focus \</emph\>is activated, the first form control will be selected when you open the document. If the button is not activated, the text will be selected after opening. The \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>Tab Order\</link\> that you have specified determines which is the first form control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
