helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146856				0	sh	ASCII Filter Options				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3153070				0	sh	You can specify which options, such as basic font, language, character set, or break, are imported or exported with a text document. The dialog appears when you load an ASCII file with the filter "Text Encoded" or when you save the document the first time, or when you "save as" with another name.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159217				0	sh	Properties				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	sh	Defines the settings for importing or exporting your file. When exporting, only the character set and paragraph break can be defined.				20181231 09:50:43
