helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN10725				0	sh	The OpenDocument file format (ODF) is a standardized file format used by many software applications. You can find more information at the Wikipedia site: \<link href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenDocument\"\>wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenDocument\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
