helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	sh	In the list field, you see all pages belonging to the selected presentation template. All pages with a checkmark in the check box next to their names will be included in the created presentation. To not include a page, clear the check box in front of the page name. Click the small plus sign that is next to the page name to display the corresponding sub-items.				20181231 09:50:43
