helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is the welcome page of the wizard. If you want to buy a serial number online, click the button. If you already have a serial number, click Next to enter the number on the next page.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
