helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159233				0	sh	Setting a Predefined Border Style				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	sh	Place the cursor in the paragraph for which you want to define a border.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Borders\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3156326				0	sh	Select one of the default border styles in the \<emph\>Default\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	sh	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	sh	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area. You can only change distances to edges that have a border line defined.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3153543				0	sh	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149237				0	sh	Setting a Customized Border Style				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Borders\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943				0	sh	In the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> area select the edge(s) that you want to appear in a common layout. Click on an edge in the preview to toggle the selection of an edge.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3148948				0	sh	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811				0	sh	Repeat the last two steps for every border edge.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	sh	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area. You can only change distances to edges that have a border line defined.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3151178				0	sh	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				20181231 09:50:43
