helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	sh	Once the cursor is located in the place where you want to insert the sheet area, release the mouse button. The sheet area is inserted as an OLE object.				20181231 09:50:43
