helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068	6			0	sh	Click the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3144510\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatline.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3144510\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to open the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
