helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator_setcursor.xhp	0	help	par_id3153348				0	sh	On the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> toolbar, you first select the category, then click on one of the buttons, \<emph\>Previous Object\</emph\> or \<emph\>Next Object\</emph\>. The names of the buttons refer to the category, for example, the button "Next Object" is named "Next Page" or "Next Bookmark" according to the category.				20181231 09:50:43
