helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FF				0	sh	Copies the formatting that is specified in Table, Text Flow, Borders, and Background tab pages in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Table\</item\> dialog. The paragraph and character formatting are also copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	sh	Calc table or cells are selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070C				0	sh	Copies the formatting that is specified in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Cells\</item\> dialog as well as the formatting of the cell contents				20181231 09:50:43
