helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10728				0	sh	You can assign custom scripts (macros) to menu items, icons, dialog controls, and events in %PRODUCTNAME.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072B				0	sh	%PRODUCTNAME internally supports the following scripting languages:				20181231 09:50:43
