helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1091F				0	sh	In addition, developers can use high-level languages, for example Java programming language, to control %PRODUCTNAME externally. See the API project at Apache OpenOffice.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10751				0	sh	To assign a script to a new menu entry				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10758				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>, and click the \<emph\>Menus\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
