helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels_database.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147399				0	sh	\<variable id=\"labels_database\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/labels_database.xhp\" name=\"Printing Address Labels\"\>Printing Address Labels\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
