helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id1175572				0	sh	In the Base window, choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id4815820				0	sh	You see the Copy Table dialog. Most databases need a primary key, so you may want to check the \<emph\>Create primary key\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id2584002				0	sh	On Windows systems, you can also use drag-and-drop instead of Copy and Paste. Also, for registered databases, you can open the datasource browser (press F4) instead of opening the Base window.				20181231 09:50:43
