helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	sh	You can save and open documents to and from several mobile devices file formats.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	sh	Currently the following filters are available:				20181231 09:50:43
