helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	sh	Installing the Pocket PC filters under Windows will also install a DLL file that supports the synchronization software of your Pocket PC.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252				0	sh	The Java Runtime Environment is required to use the mobile device filters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153665				0	sh	Installing the mobile device filters				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	sh	Close $[officename] and the Quickstarter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	sh	If you are using the Windows operating system with ActiveSync installed, disconnect any Pocket PC device from ActiveSync.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153061				0	sh	Start the $[officename] Setup program:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E7				0	sh	Open the Windows \<emph\>Start\</emph\> button, choose \<emph\>Control Panel\</emph\>, double-click \<emph\>Add or Remove Programs\</emph\>, select the %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION entry, click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794				0	sh	In Setup, choose the \<emph\>Modify\</emph\> option and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	sh	Open the \<emph\>Optional Components\</emph\> entry, then open the \<emph\>Mobile Device Filters\</emph\> entry. Select the filters you want to install.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	sh	Click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>, \<emph\>Next\</emph\>, \<emph\>Install\</emph\>, \<emph\>Finish\</emph\> to install the filters and exit the Setup program.				20181231 09:50:43
