helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148672				0	sh	Open the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box and select the appropriate filter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	sh	Enter a name and click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
