helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	sh	If you often want to access only a subset of your data that can be well defined by a filter condition, you can define a query. This is basically a name for the new view at the filtered data. You open the query and see the current data in the table layout that you defined.				20181231 09:50:43
