helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id9296243				0	sh	Actions carried out in another window than where the recorder was started are not recorded.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id4269234				0	sh	Window switching is not recorded.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id8014465				0	sh	Actions that are not related to the document contents are not recorded. For example, changes made in the Options dialog, macro organizer, customizing.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id2814416				0	sh	Selections are recorded only if they are done by using the keyboard (cursor traveling), but not when the mouse is used.				20181231 09:50:43
