helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id7296975				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Reset\</emph\> to reset the toolbars to their default context sensitive behavior. Now some toolbars will be shown automatically, dependent on the context.				20181231 09:50:43
