helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tables.xhp	0	help	par_idN10778				0	sh	Creating a New Table View				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tables.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077C				0	sh	Some database types support table views. A table view is a query that is stored with the database. For most database operations, a view can be used as you would use a table.				20181231 09:50:43
