helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	sh	With the help of SQL commands you can control the database directly, and can also create and edit tables and queries.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562				0	sh	Not all database types support all SQL instructions. If necessary, find out which SQL commands are supported by your database system.				20181231 09:50:43
