helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A6F				0	sh	In the list of filters, select the filter that you want to test, and click \<emph\>Test XSLTs\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A82				0	sh	To test an \<emph\>Export\</emph\> Filter, do one of the following in the \<emph\>Export\</emph\> area of the dialog:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10DEB				0	sh	Click \<emph\>Browse\</emph\>, select the %PRODUCTNAME document that you want to test, and click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10DF7				0	sh	To test the current document, click \<emph\>Current Document\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A99				0	sh	To test an \<emph\>Import\</emph\> Filter, click \<emph\>Browse\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Import\</emph\> area of the dialog, select a document, and click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E32				0	sh	To validate the transformed file against the specified DTD, click \<emph\>Validate\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
