helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id9359111				0	sh	When saving a file, %PRODUCTNAME always appends an extension to the file name, except when the file name already has an extension that matches the file type. See the list of \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000021.xhp\"\>ODF extensions\</link\>. 				20181231 09:50:43
