helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070D				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>File - New - XML Form Document\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10714				0	sh	The XForms design window opens in an empty Writer document.				20181231 09:50:43
