helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147291				0	sh	\<variable id=\"chart_legend\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/chart_legend.xhp\" name=\"Editing Chart Legends\"\>Editing Chart Legends\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	sh	To edit a chart legend:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	sh	Double-click on the chart.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3154824				0	sh	A gray border appears around the chart and the menu bar now contains commands for editing the objects in the chart.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3153031				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Format - Legend\</emph\> or double-click on the legend. This opens the \<emph\>Legend\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3147210				0	sh	Choose from the available tabs to make modifications, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3145674				0	sh	To select the legend, first double-click on the chart (see step 1), then click on the legend. You can now move the legend within the chart using the mouse.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3154347				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05010000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Object Properties\"\>Format - Object Properties\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
