helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3154840				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_EDIT_DLG_HELP_ADDBOOKMARK_ED_BOOKMARK_TITLE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the name of the bookmarked page. You can also type a new name for the bookmark.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149140				0	sh	\<image src=\"sfx2/res/favourite.png\" id=\"img_id3149549\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149549\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145314				0	sh	Use the \<emph\>Add to Bookmarks\</emph\> icon to set a bookmark for the current page shown in the Help.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	sh	You can find the bookmarks on the \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\> tab page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Double-clicking a bookmark or pressing the Return key opens the assigned page in Help. A right-click opens the context menu.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	sh	Use the Del key to delete a selected bookmark.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	sh	The following commands are on the context menu of a bookmark:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	sh	\<emph\>Display\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_OPEN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>displays the selected help subject\</ahelp\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	sh	\<emph\>Rename\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>opens a dialog for entering another name for the bookmark\</ahelp\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	sh	\<emph\>Delete\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_DELETE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>deletes the bookmark selected \</ahelp\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Getting Support				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143272				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>support on the Web\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>getting support\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>forums and support\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>Web support\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146873				0	sh	\<variable id=\"00000001\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000001.xhp\" name=\"Getting Support\"\>Getting Support\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id9173253				0	sh	Many questions and answers are the same for %PRODUCTNAME software and for the commercial office software.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150667				0	sh	You can find support on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	sh	For a summary of the current support services refer to the \<emph\>Readme\</emph\> file in the \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> folder.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id26327				0	sh	Local language support pages				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id1318380				0	sh	The %PRODUCTNAME localization projects offer support pages in local languages. Find an overview of the native language projects at \<link href=\"https://projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\"\>projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\</link\>. You can find help and support in English language on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2611386				0	sh	Mailing lists				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166335				0	sh	Ask about %PRODUCTNAME, find help by volunteers, and discuss topics on the public mailing lists. You can find many general and specialized mailing lists on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\"\>www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0915200811081722				0	sh	Forum				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200811081778				0	sh	You can access web forums to ask and answer questions about %PRODUCTNAME.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0804200803314150				0	sh	Security				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200803314235				0	sh	In case you are concerned about any security issue with using this software, please refer to the \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/security/index.html\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Security\</link\> page on our website.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3168534				0	sh	Downloads				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3028143				0	sh	You can download the latest version of %PRODUCTNAME at \<link href=\"https://download.openoffice.org/\"\>download.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2602967				0	sh	Documentation				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3497211				0	sh	You can download documentation as PDF files, how-tos, and guides from the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://documentation.openoffice.org\"\>documentation.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0120200910361765				0	sh	Participate and give back				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361848				0	sh	If you want to take an active role in the worldwide %PRODUCTNAME community, you are very welcome to give feedback, discuss features, propose enhancements, write your own article in an FAQ, how-to, manual, create a video tutorial, etc.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361874				0	sh	Visit the \<link href=\"https://documentation.openoffice.org/\"\>documentation web site\</link\> or the \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation\"\>Wiki starting page\</link\> and follow the links for contributors.				20181231 09:50:43
