helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520	2			0	sh	The Help Agent, Tips, and Extended Tips provide help while you work. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285				0	sh	The Help Agent				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	sh	The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent\"\>Help Agent\</link\> starts automatically when you are performing a task that might require some assistance. The Help Agent appears in a small window in a corner of the document. To view the help for the task, click inside the Help Agent window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	sh	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore or close the Help Agent three times you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task. To disable the Help Agent choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	sh	Tips				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896				0	sh	Tips provide you with the names of toolbar buttons. To display a tip, rest the pointer over a toolbar button until the name of the button appears.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	sh	Tips are also displayed for some elements in a document, such as chapter names when you scroll through a long document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id992156				0	sh	Enable or disable the tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	sh	Extended Tips				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	sh	Extended tips provide a brief description about buttons and commands. To display an extended tip, press Shift+F1, then point to a button or command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	sh	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Index - Keyword Search in the Help				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149428				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>Index tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; keywords\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	sh	\<variable id=\"00000130\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index - Keyword Search in the Help\"\>Index - Keyword Search in the Help\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3150960				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_INDEX_CB_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Double-click an entry or type the word you want to find in the index.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3148668				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_INDEX_PB_OPEN_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to display the selected topic.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	sh	You can search for a specific topic by typing a word into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box. The window contains an alphabetical list of index terms.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669				0	sh	If the cursor is in the index list when you type the search term, the display will jump directly to the next match. When you type a word in the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box, the focus will jump to the best match in the index list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	sh	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	sh	\<variable id=\"00000110\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window\"\>The \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help Window\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	sh	The Help system for all versions of the software is based on the same source files. Some of the functions described in Help may not be included in this particular distribution. Some features specific to a distribution may not be mentioned in this Help.				20181231 09:50:43
