helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the print setting options.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148451				0	sh	Reduce print data				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	sh	You can reduce the amount of data to be sent to the printer. Reducing the print data increases the print speed because the print files are smaller. This makes it easier for printers with a smaller memory to print. Reducing print data can result in slightly lower print quality.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147085				0	sh	Settings for				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3158407				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_PRINTFILEOUTPUT\"\>Specifies whether the print settings apply to direct printing or to printing to a file.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145786				0	sh	Reduce transparency				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY\"\>If you mark this field the transparent objects will be printed like normal, non-transparent objects, depending on your selection in the following two option buttons.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	sh	Transparency cannot be output directly to a printer. The areas of the document in which transparency is to be visible must therefore always be calculated as bitmaps and sent to the printer. Depending on the size of the bitmaps and the print resolution a large amount of data may result.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147441				0	sh	Automatically				20181231 09:50:43
