helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	sh	Defines how the connections to data sources are pooled.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088	3			0	sh	The\<emph\> Connections \</emph\>facility allows you to stipulate that connections that are no longer needed are not deleted immediately, but are kept free for a certain period of time. If a new connection to the data source is needed in that period, the free connection can be used for this purpose.				20181231 09:50:43
