helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id7242042				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable this option to print text placeholders. Disable this option to leave the text placeholders blank in the printout.\</ahelp\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\"\>Text placeholders\</link\> are fields.				20181231 09:50:43
