helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	bm_id7687094				0	sh	         \<bookmark_value\>online feedback options\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>options;improvement program\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>improvement program\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>feedback;automatically\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>user feedback;automatically\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200912315340				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/improvement.xhp\"\>Improvement Program\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200312315378				0	sh	The Improvement Program records some user interactions and sends them to the User Experience project.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594966				0	sh	The Improvement Program was initiated by the User Experience project to improve the usability of %PRODUCTNAME. The User Experience project can be found at the Apache OpenOffice website: \<link href=\"https://ux.openoffice.org/\"\>ux.openoffice.org/\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594946				0	sh	The second time you start your new %PRODUCTNAME software, you see a window that gives information about the Improvement Program. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094345				0	sh	At this time you can choose to accept or deny your participation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id052620090409438				0	sh	If you accept, data recording starts immediately. When you start a new session of %PRODUCTNAME, the collected data will be sent. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094433				0	sh	If you deny to participate, no data will be sent and recording of data stops immediately.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594945				0	sh	At any time, you can enable or disable the recording of user interaction data and the sending of these data. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Improvement Program\</item\>. Click the \<emph\>Info\</emph\> icon to browse to a web page with more information.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594944				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>Yes, I am willing to participate …\</emph\> to enable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595080				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>No, I do not wish to participate\</emph\> to disable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595037				0	sh	Tracked data				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595096				0	sh	The following data will be recorded and sent:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595033				0	sh	Clicks on toolbar buttons, including extension toolbars 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595014				0	sh	Execution of menu commands, including extension menus				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595145				0	sh	Clicks on context menu commands				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595115				0	sh	Fonts applied by using the menu 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595144				0	sh	Font sizes applied by using the menu 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595146				0	sh	Buttons, like OK, Cancel, etc. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595296				0	sh	Document language and paragraph language applied by using the menu or status bar 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595242				0	sh	Each recorded item also includes a time stamp and the module (Writer, Calc, Impress, …) where it has been called 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595229				0	sh	The following data will not be recorded and sent:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595234				0	sh	User names and passwords 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595218				0	sh	Any type of document content 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595213				0	sh	Paths, filenames 				20181231 09:50:43
