helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10659				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"703988741\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to sign a document that contains recorded changes, versions, fields, references to other sources (for example linked sections or linked pictures), or comments.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
