helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156276				0	sh	The HTML filter supports CSS2 (Cascading Style Sheets Level 2) for printing documents. These capabilities are only effective if print layout export is activated.				20181231 09:50:43
