helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_SEARCH\"\>Use this tab page to define the settings for searching in the Internet.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
