helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152962				0	sh	Insert (not for HTML document)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149020				0	sh	Defines the insert options for the direct cursor. If you click at any position in your document, a new paragraph can be written or inserted exactly at this position. The properties of this paragraph depend on the selected option. You can select from the following options:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148995				0	sh	Paragraph alignment				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384	10			0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:RB_SHDWCRSFILLMARGIN\"\>Sets the paragraph alignment when the direct cursor is used. Depending on where the mouse is clicked, the paragraph is formatted left aligned, centered or right aligned. The cursor before the mouse-click shows, by means of a triangle, which alignment is set. \</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150387				0	sh	Left paragraph margin				20181231 09:50:43
