helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04160500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100				0	sh	If you want to create HTML pages that use floating frames, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - HTML compatibility\</emph\>, and then select the "MS Internet Explorer" option. The floating frame is bounded by <IFRAME> and </IFRAME> tags.				20181231 09:50:43
