helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3150603				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Trims or scales the selected graphic. You can also restore the graphic to its original size.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148585				0	sh	Crop				20181231 09:50:43
