helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148990				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_STD_PARAGRAPH:ED_LEFTINDENT\"\>Enter the amount of space that you want to indent the paragraph from the page margin. If you want the paragraph to extend into the page margin, enter a negative number. In Left-to-Right languages, the left edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the left page margin. In Right-to-Left languages, the right edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the right page margin.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152361				0	sh	After text				20181231 09:50:43
