helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1161534				0	sh	The Data tab page of the Properties dialog for an XML Form document offers some XML forms settings.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id3994567				0	sh	The possible settings of the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page of a control depend on the respective control. You will only see the options that are available for the current control and context. The following fields are available:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	hd_id9461653				0	sh	XML data model				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id9239173				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select a model from the list of all models in the current document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	hd_id2656941				0	sh	Binding				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1481063				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select or enter the name of a binding. Selecting the name of an existing binding associates the binding with the form control. Entering a new name creates a new binding and associates it with the form control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	hd_id7921079				0	sh	Binding expression				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id636921				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter the DOM node to bind the control model to. Click the ... button for a dialog to enter the XPath expression.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
