helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4181951				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select a user-defined data type and click the button to delete the user-defined data type.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
