helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148882				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Italic\"\>Makes the selected text italic. If the cursor is in a word, the entire word is made italic. If the selection or word is already italic, the formatting is removed.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
