helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	sh	You can also apply a shadow effect to borders. For the best results, only apply this effect when all four borders are visible.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3157309				0	sh	Graphics or objects that are anchored to a frame in the document cannot exceed the size of the frame. If you apply a shadow to the borders of an object that fills an entire frame, the size of the object is reduced to display the shadows.				20181231 09:50:43
