helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	sh	In text documents, you can choose to apply the AutoCorrect corrections while you type [T], or only when you modify existing text [M] with \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - Apply\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id7547227				0	sh	When you choose to modify existing text with all options deselected, still all "Default" paragraph styles will be converted to "Text body" styles. 				20181231 09:50:43
