helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150144				0	sh	Correct TWo INitial CApitals				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	sh	If you type two uppercase letters at the beginning of a "WOrd", the second uppercase letter is automatically replaced with a lowercase letter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156426				0	sh	Capitalize first letter of every sentence.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155339				0	sh	Capitalizes the first letter of every sentence.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id5240028				0	sh	The first letter in a Calc cell will never be capitalized automatically.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	sh	Automatic *bold* and _underline_				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	sh	Automatically applies bold formatting to text enclosed by asterisks (*), and underline to text enclosed by underscores ( _ ), for example, *bold*. The asterisks and underscores are not displayed after the formatting is applied.				20181231 09:50:43
