helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id1002200811423556				0	sh	For example, if your software is set to an English locale, and you want to format a year with four digits, you enter YYYY as a formatting code. When you switch to a German locale, you must use JJJJ instead. The following table lists only the localized differences.				20181231 09:50:43
