helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_CTL_ORGANIZER_RIGHT\"\>Displays the available template categories or opened $[officename] files. To change the contents of the list, select \<emph\>Templates\</emph\> or \<emph\>Documents\</emph\> in the box below.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	sh	To change the default template path, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010300.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Paths\"\>$[officename] - Paths\</link\>\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154810				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:LISTBOX:DLG_ORGANIZE:LB_RIGHT_TYP\"\>Select \<emph\>Templates\</emph\> or \<emph\>Documents\</emph\> to change the contents that are displayed in the list above.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149191				0	sh	Template categories are represented by folder icons. To view the template files for a category, double-click a folder.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159166				0	sh	To view the styles that are used in a file, double-click the file name, and then double-click the \<emph\>Styles\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155504				0	sh	To copy a style, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>and drag the style from one file to another file. To move a style, drag the style from one file to another file.				20181231 09:50:43
