helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3479720				0	sh	The Adabas D software package can be downloaded and installed separately (see www.adabas.com).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152997				0	sh	About Adabas				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	sh	The free available Adabas database is restricted to a size of 100 MB, and a maximum of three users on a network. See the "License.txt" file in the Adabas directory for more details. The Adabas database must be installed in a separate directory from $[officename].				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	sh	The name of an Adabas file cannot exceed 8 characters. The path to the Adabas file, including the file name, cannot exceed 30 characters, and must be compliant with the 7-bit ASCII code. Both the path and the file name cannot contain spaces.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153254				0	sh	Under Windows, the Adabas setup application adds the DBROOT environment variable that contains the path information for the database. If the setup application finds this variable, it does not install the database.				20181231 09:50:43
