helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id1393475				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select two or more objects and click this icon to resize the objects to the smallest height.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
