helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id3405560				0	sh	By default a new group is created on every changed value of a record from the selected field. You can change this property depending on the type of field:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id3409527				0	sh	For fields of type Text, you can select Prefix Characters and enter a number n of characters in the text box below. The records which are identical in the first n characters will be grouped together.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id7112338				0	sh	For fields of type Date/Time, you can group the records by the same year, quarter, month, week, day, hour, or minute. You can additionally specify an interval for weeks and hours: 2 weeks groups data in biweekly groups, 12 hours groups data in half-day groups.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id2855616				0	sh	For fields of type AutoNumber, Currency, or Number, you specify an interval.				20181231 09:50:43
