helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id2091433				0	sh	When you specify to keep together some records on the same page, you have three choices:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id5092318				0	sh	No - page boundaries are not taken into account.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id9312417				0	sh	Whole Group - prints the group header, detail section, and group footer on the same page.				20181231 09:50:43
