helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157977				0	sh	Database size (MB)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150115				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DATADEVSPACE_SIZE\"\>Enter the size of the database in megabytes here. The maximum size is 100 MB.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155415				0	sh	Data buffer size (MB)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149378	31			0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_CACHE_SIZE\"\>Enter the size of the data cache in megabytes. \</ahelp\> The data buffer can be simultaneously accessed by all users and stores the most recently accessed pages from the DATADEVSPACEs.				20181231 09:50:43
