helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147546				0	sh	You can also assign an index or an exponent to a function. For example, typing \<emph\>sin^2x\</emph\> results in in a function "sine to the power of 2x".				20181231 09:50:43
