helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091506.xhp	0	help	par_id3161843				0	sh	The \<emph\>color\</emph\> command changes the character color; first enter the \<emph\>color\</emph\> command directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. Then enter the color name (white, silver, gray, black, red, maroon, yellow, olive, lime, green, aqua, teal, blue, navy, fuchsia, purple, cyan, magenta). Then enter the characters to be changed.				20181231 09:50:43
