helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id6129947				0	sh	To change chart data				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id8141117				0	sh	When you create a chart that is based on default data, or when you copy a chart into your document, you can open the Data Table dialog to enter your own data. The chart responds to the data in a live preview.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id9487594				0	sh	Close the Chart Data dialog to apply all changes to the chart. Choose \<emph\>Edit - Undo\</emph\> to cancel the changes.				20181231 09:50:43
