helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150792				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>charts; formatting walls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatting;chart walls\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
