helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685	2			0	sh	\<variable id=\"diagramm\"\>\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\".uno:DiagramWall\"\>Opens the\<emph\> Chart Wall\</emph\> dialog, where you can modify the properties of the chart wall. The chart wall is the "vertical" background behind the data area of the chart.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
