helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150327				0	sh	ABCD wheel				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCH_ALIGNMENT_CTR_DIAL\"\>Clicking anywhere on the wheel defines the variable text orientation.\</ahelp\> The letters "ABCD" on the button correspond to the new setting.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154254				0	sh	ABCD button				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCH_ALIGNMENT_STACKED\"\>Assigns vertical text orientation for cell contents.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150342				0	sh	If you define a vertical x-axis label, the text may be cut off by the line of the x-axis.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166432				0	sh	Degrees				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150199				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCH_ALIGNMENT_DEGREES\"\>Allows you to manually enter the orientation angle.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152985				0	sh	Text flow				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155089				0	sh	Determines the text flow of the data label.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148837				0	sh	Overlap				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151240				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:TP_AXIS_LABEL:CB_AXIS_LABEL_TEXTOVERLAP\"\>Specifies that the text in cells may overlap other cells.\</ahelp\> This can be especially useful if there is a lack of space. This option is not available with different title directions.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157982				0	sh	Break				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155268				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:TP_AXIS_LABEL:CB_AXIS_LABEL_TEXTBREAK\"\>Allows a text break.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159205				0	sh	The following options are not available for all chart types:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152872				0	sh	Order				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159230				0	sh	The options on this tab are only available for a 2D chart, under \<emph\>Format - Axis - Y Axis\</emph\> or \<emph\>X Axis\</emph\>. In this area, you can define the alignment of the number labels on the X or Y axis.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146963				0	sh	Tile				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155758				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:RADIOBUTTON:TP_AXIS_LABEL:RB_AXIS_LABEL_SIDEBYSIDE\"\>Arranges numbers on the axis side by side.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151195				0	sh	Stagger odd				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145114				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:RADIOBUTTON:TP_AXIS_LABEL:RB_AXIS_LABEL_UPDOWN\"\>Staggers numbers on the axis, even numbers lower than odd numbers.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
