helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id1356547				0	sh	Every slide is based on a slide master. The text, pictures, tables, fields or other objects that you place on the slide master are visible as a background on all slides that are based on that slide master.				20181231 09:50:43
