helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id4101077				0	sh	By default, the \<emph\>Date and Time\</emph\> checkbox is enabled, but the format is set to Fixed and the text input box is empty, so no date and time is visible on the slides.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id204779				0	sh	By default, the \<emph\>Footer\</emph\> checkbox is enabled, but the text input box is empty, so no footer is visible on the slides.				20181231 09:50:43
