helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id1956236				0	sh	If you want to change the position and formatting of the master objects, choose \<emph\>View - Master - Slide Master\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id5259559				0	sh	You see the slide master with areas near the bottom. You can move the areas , and you can select the fields and apply some formatting. You can also enter some text here which will be shown next to the fields.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id2521439				0	sh	Click the Date Area and move the time and date field. Select the <date/time> field and apply some formatting to change the format for the date and time on all slides. The same applies to the Footer Area and the Slide Number Area.				20181231 09:50:43
