helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150746				0	sh	If your text contains more than one character, the converted text becomes a grouped object. Double-click the group to edit individual objects. Press Esc when finished.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150336				0	sh	Now, click the \<emph\>Points\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar. Click the object. You can see all the Bézier points of the object. On the \<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\> bar, you can find various icons for editing, inserting and deleting points.				20181231 09:50:43
