helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3149756				0	sh	To tile the image on the background, select \<emph\>Tile\</emph\>, and set the \<emph\>Size\</emph\>, \<emph\>Position\</emph\>, and \<emph\>Offset\</emph\> options for the image.				20181231 09:50:43
