helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082F				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\> to change the slide background, or choose other formatting commands. Objects that you add here will be visible on all slides that are based on this slide master.				20181231 09:50:43
