helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id9209875				0	sh	Insert a native table - you enter the data into the cells and apply fancy formatting using the Table Design section on the Tasks pane.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3044526				0	sh	Insert a new table as an OLE object or insert an existing file as an OLE object - you can specify the link to a file to be a live link to the latest data saved in a spreadsheet file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id137333				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the number of columns for the new table.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
