helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551651				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The cell contents are align at the top of the cells.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
