helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id8594317				0	sh	Inserting a native table				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7184972				0	sh	Go to the Impress slide or Draw page where you want to insert the table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id248115				0	sh	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Table\</item\> or use the Table icon on the Standard toolbar to insert a table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id2748496				0	sh	Double-click the table and enter or paste the data into the cells. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id8270210				0	sh	Select some cell contents and right-click to open the context menu. Choose commands to change the cell's contents, like font size and line spacing.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6820276				0	sh	Right-click the table border to open the table's context menu. Use the table's context menu to enter a name and description for the table, or to distribute the rows or columns equally, among other commands.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551725				0	sh	Select some cells and right-click to open a context menu, where you can insert or delete rows and columns, among other commands. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id091620080355171				0	sh	To select a rectangular area of cells, point to a cell in one corner of the rectangle, hold down the mouse button, and drag the mouse to the opposite corner of the rectangle, then release the mouse button. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551880				0	sh	To select one cell, point to that cell, hold down the mouse button, and drag the mouse to the next cell and back, then release the mouse button.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151075				0	sh	Inserting a new spreadsheet as an OLE object				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	sh	You can add a blank $[officename] Calc spreadsheet to a slide as an OLE object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	sh	Go to the slide where you want to insert the spreadsheet.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313	18			0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Insert - OLE- Object\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Create new\</emph\> and select the %PRODUCTNAME Spreadsheet. Click OK. Click in the spreadsheet to enter your data. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id2466505				0	sh	Click outside the spreadsheet to view the slide.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148870				0	sh	To resize the spreadsheet without resizing the cells, double-click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle. To resize the cells of the spreadsheet, click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150215				0	sh	Inserting a spreadsheet from a file				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154765				0	sh	When you insert an existing spreadsheet into your slide, changes that are made to the original spreadsheet file are not updated on your slide. You can, however, make changes to the spreadsheet in your slide.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145112				0	sh	Go to the slide where you want to insert the spreadsheet.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153075				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Object - OLE Object\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391				0	sh	Select \<emph\>Create from file\</emph\>, and click \<emph\>Search\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537	20			0	sh	Locate the file you want to insert, and then click\<emph\> OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id1616565				0	sh	Enable the \<emph\>Link to file\</emph\> checkbox to insert the file as a live link.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155256				0	sh	The entire spreadsheet is inserted into your slide. If you want to change the sheet that is displayed, double-click the spreadsheet, and then select a different sheet.				20181231 09:50:43
