helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596				0	sh	\<variable id=\"masterpage\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/masterpage.xhp\" name=\"Applying a Slide Design to a Slide Master\"\>Applying a Slide Design to a Slide Master\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017				0	sh	Every slide in a presentation has exactly one slide master, also known as master page. A slide master determines the text formatting style for the title and outline and the background design for all slides that use this slide master.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149018				0	sh	To apply a new slide master				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	sh	Select \<emph\>Format - Slide Design\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3148485				0	sh	Click \<emph\>Load\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	sh	Under \<emph\>Categories\</emph\>, select a slide design category.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3153915	26			0	sh	Under \<emph\>Templates\</emph\>, select a template with the design that you want to apply. To preview the template, click \<emph\>More\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Preview \</emph\>box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154652				0	sh	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145115				0	sh	Do one of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150436				0	sh	To apply the slide design to all of the slides in your presentation, select the \<emph\>Exchange background page\</emph\> check box, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	sh	To apply the slide design to the current slide only, clear the \<emph\>Exchange background page\</emph\> check box, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
