helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	sh	To create a flowchart:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	sh	Select a tool from the \<emph\>Flowchart\</emph\> toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				20181231 09:50:43
