helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	sh	To add more shapes, repeat the last steps.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146967	43			0	sh	Open the \<emph\>Connectors \</emph\>toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and select a connector line.				20181231 09:50:43
