helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\move_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	sh	You can move selected objects in your slide by dragging them, using the arrow keys, or by copying the objects and pasting them in another location.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\move_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799				0	sh	The arrow keys let you move objects more precisely than with the mouse.				20181231 09:50:43
