helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740				0	sh	To save a gradients list, click the \<emph\>Save Gradients List\</emph\> button, enter a filename, and then click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
