helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AD				0	sh	Column three shows a mouse icon if the animation is started by a mouse click, and a clock if the animation starts after the previous animation ends.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B1				0	sh	In column four, an icon shows the animation effect.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B5				0	sh	The fifth column shows the name of the shape for this animation effect and optionally the first characters of animated text.				20181231 09:50:43
