helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	sh	Allows you to insert the entire file or specific elements in the file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154016				0	sh	To insert specific elements from a file:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749	4			0	sh	Click the plus sign next to the file name and select the elements you want to insert. Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to add to or Shift to expand your selection.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962				0	sh	If you want to insert the file as a link, select \<emph\>Link\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
