helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159236	7			0	sh	At the prompt, click \<emph\>Yes \</emph\>to scale the elements to fit on the slide or \<emph\>No \</emph\>to preserve the original size of the elements.				20181231 09:50:43
