helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151243				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_MEASURE:MTR_FLD_HELPLINE_OVERHANG\"\>Specifies the length of the left and right guides starting at the baseline (line distance = 0). Positive values extend the guides above the baseline and negative values extend the guides below the baseline.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
