helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellcopy.xhp	0	help	par_id3148577				0	sh	Assume you have hidden a few rows in a cell range. Now you want to copy, delete, or format only the remaining visible rows.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellcopy.xhp	0	help	par_id3154729				0	sh	$[officename] behavior depends on how the cells were made invisible, by a filter or manually.				20181231 09:50:43
