helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Entering Formulas 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150868				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>formula bar; input line\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>input line in formula bar\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formulas; inputting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting;formulas\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150868				0	sh	\<variable id=\"formula_enter\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/formula_enter.xhp\" name=\"Entering Formulas\"\>Entering Formulas\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id6848353				0	sh	You can enter formulas in several ways: using the icons, or by typing on the keyboard, or by a mixture of both methods.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3145364				0	sh	Click the cell in which you want to enter the formula.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150012				0	sh	Click the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> icon on the Formula Bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	sh	You will now see an equals sign in the input line and you can begin to input the formula.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	sh	After entering the required values, press Enter or click \<emph\>Accept\</emph\> to insert the result in the active cell. If you want to clear your entry in the input line, press Escape or click \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	sh	You can also enter the values and the formulas directly into the cells, even if you cannot see an input cursor. Formulas must always begin with an equals sign.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id4206976				0	sh	You can also press the + or - key on the numerical keyboard to start a formula. NumLock must be "on". For example, press the following keys in succession:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id1836909				0	sh	+ 5 0 - 8 Enter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id8171330				0	sh	You see the result \<item type=\"literal\"\>42\</item\> in the cell. The cell contains the formula \<item type=\"literal\"\>=+50-8\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	sh	If you are editing a formula with references, the references and the associated cells will be highlighted with the same color. You can now resize the reference border using the mouse, and the reference in the formula displayed in the input line also changes. \<emph\>Show references in color\</emph\> can be deactivated under \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060300.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - View\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3149210	7			0	sh	\<variable id=\"tip\"\>If you would like to view the calculation of individual elements of a formula, select the respective elements and press F9. For example, in the formula =SUM(A1:B12)*SUM(C1:D12) select the section SUM(C1:D12) and press F9 to view the subtotal for this area. \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150304				0	sh	If an error occurs when creating the formula, an \<link href=\"text/scalc/05/02140000.xhp\" name=\"error message\"\>error message\</link\> appears in the active cell.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3152993				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/scalc/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Formula bar\"\>Formula bar\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
