helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147304				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>row headers; hiding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>column headers; hiding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables; views\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>views; tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>grids;hiding lines in sheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiding;headers/grid lines\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>changing;table views\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147304				0	sh	\<variable id=\"table_view\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/table_view.xhp\" name=\"Changing Table Views\"\>Changing Table Views\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	sh	To hide column and line headers in a table:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	sh	Under the menu item \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc,\</emph\> go to the \<emph\>View\</emph\> tab page. Unmark\<emph\> Column/row headers\</emph\>. Confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436				0	sh	To hide grid lines:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	sh	Under the menu item \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc\</emph\>\<emph\>,\</emph\> go to the \<emph\>View\</emph\> tab page. Unmark \<emph\>Grid lines\</emph\>. Confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
