helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017				0	sh	You can change the height of the rows with the mouse or through the dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	sh	What is described here for rows and row height applies accordingly for columns and column width.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153963				0	sh	Using the mouse to change the row height or column width				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	sh	Click the area of the headers on the separator below the current row, keep the mouse button pressed and drag up or down in order to change the row height.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3159237				0	sh	Select the optimal row height by double-clicking the separator below the row.				20181231 09:50:43
