helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3150367				0	sh	Click the row so that you achieve the focus.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3166432				0	sh	Start the context menu on the header at the left-hand side.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	sh	You will see the commands \<emph\>Row Height\</emph\> and \<emph\>Optimal row height\</emph\>. Choosing either opens a dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
