helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	sh	Alternatively, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option key\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt key\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and click on any sheet name and enter the new name directly.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502833				0	sh	Sheet names can contain almost any character. Some naming restrictions apply when you want to save the spreadsheet to Microsoft Excel format.				20181231 09:50:43
