helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id8102053				0	sh	You can combine several line types and styles. The last image shows how to set thick outer borders (the thick black lines), while any diagonal lines inside the cell will not be touched (gray lines).				20181231 09:50:43
