helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752				0	sh	To choose the details proceed as follows:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3145640				0	sh	Select the sheet you want to print.				20181231 09:50:43
