helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340	13			0	sh	The command is not visible if the sheet was opened with write protection on. In that case, click the \<emph\>Edit File \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> Bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3146916	14			0	sh	Select the \<emph\>Sheet\</emph\> tab. In the \<emph\>Print \</emph\>area mark the details to be printed and click OK.				20181231 09:50:43
