helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155132				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>tables; AutoFormat function\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>defining;AutoFormat function for tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>AutoFormat function\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formats; automatically formatting spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic formatting in spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sheets;AutoFormat function\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132				0	sh	\<variable id=\"autoformat\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/autoformat.xhp\" name=\"Using AutoFormat for Tables\"\>Applying Automatic Formatting to a Selected Cell Range\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3149401				0	sh	You can use the AutoFormat feature to quickly apply a format to a sheet or a selected cell range.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10702				0	sh	To Apply an AutoFormat to a Sheet or Selected Cell Range				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CE				0	sh	Select the cells, including the column and row headers, that you want to format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	sh	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - AutoFormat\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242				0	sh	To select which properties to include in an AutoFormat, click \<emph\>More\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10715				0	sh	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075D				0	sh	The format is applied to the selected range of cells.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3149210				0	sh	If you do not see any change in color of the cell contents, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Value Highlighting\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3155379				0	sh	To Define an AutoFormat for Spreadsheets				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3148868				0	sh	You can define a new AutoFormat that is available to all spreadsheets.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3152985				0	sh	Format a sheet.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	sh	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Select All\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815				0	sh	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - AutoFormat\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A9				0	sh	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10760				0	sh	In the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box of the \<emph\>Add AutoFormat\</emph\> dialog, enter a name for the format.				20181231 09:50:43
