helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_datevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281				0	sh	The internal date number is returned as a number. The number is determined by the date system that is used by $[officename] to calculate dates.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_datevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200903491982				0	sh	If the text string also includes a time value, DATEVALUE only returns the integer part of the conversion.				20181231 09:50:43
