helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3166423				0	sh	Defines the order in which data in a sheet is numbered and printed when it does not fit on one printed page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152580				0	sh	Top to bottom, then right				20181231 09:50:43
