helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148868				0	sh	Fit print range(s) on number of pages				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145074				0	sh	Specifies the maximum number of pages on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. The scale will be reduced as necessary to fit the defined number of pages.				20181231 09:50:43
