helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_hour.xhp	0	help	par_id3150637				0	sh	HOUR(Number)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_hour.xhp	0	help	par_id3147547				0	sh	\<emph\>Number\</emph\>, as a time value, is a decimal, for which the hour is to be returned.				20181231 09:50:43
