helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_hour.xhp	0	help	par_id3159215				0	sh	\<item type=\"input\"\>=HOUR(NOW())\</item\> returns the current hour				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_hour.xhp	0	help	par_id3145152				0	sh	\<item type=\"input\"\>=HOUR(C4)\</item\> returns 17 if the contents of C4 = \<item type=\"input\"\>17:20:00\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
