helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id9210486				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Solver dialog. A solver allows to solve equations with multiple unknown variables by goal seeking methods.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id8538773				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter or click the cell reference of the target cell. This field takes the address of the cell whose value is to be optimized.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id7564012				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Try to solve the equation for a maximum value of the target cell.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id1186254				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Try to solve the equation for a minimum value of the target cell.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
