helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154943				0	sh	Calculate subtotals for				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147125				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SUBT_COLS\"\>Select the column(s) containing the values that you want to subtotal.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
