helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156285				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Automatically fills cells with content.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147343				0	sh	The $[officename] Calc context menus have \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"other options\"\>additional options\</link\> for filling the cells.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149207				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140500.xhp\" name=\"Sheet\"\>Sheet\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155111				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140600.xhp\" name=\"Rows\"\>Series\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152994				0	sh	\<emph\>Filling cells using context menus:\</emph\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	sh	Call the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> when positioned in a cell and choose \<emph\>Selection List\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataSelect\"\>A list box containing all text found in the current column is displayed.\</ahelp\> The text is sorted alphabetically and multiple entries are listed only once.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	sh	Click one of the listed entries to copy it to the cell.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07080000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Split				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163800				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/07080000.xhp\" name=\"Split\"\>Split\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SplitWindow\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Divides the current window at the top left corner of the active cell.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	sh	You can also use the mouse to split the window horizontally or vertically. To do this, drag the thick black line located directly above the vertical scrollbar or directly to the right of the horizontal scrollbar into the window. A thick black line will show where the window is split.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149263				0	sh	A split window has its own scrollbars in each partial section; by contrast, \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/07090000.xhp\" name=\"fixed window sections\"\>fixed window sections\</link\> are not scrollable.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Options				20181231 09:50:43
