helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153836	13			0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_CONSOLIDATE:ED_DATA_AREA\"\>Specifies the cell range that you want to consolidate with the cell ranges listed in the \<emph\>Consolidation ranges \</emph\>box. Select a cell range in a sheet, and then click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>. You can also select a the name of a predefined cell from the \<emph\>Source data range \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
