helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153360				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; moving\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; copying\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>moving; spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>copying; spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153360				0	sh	Move or Copy a Sheet				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686				0	sh	\<variable id=\"tabelleverschiebenkopierentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Move\"\>Moves or copies a sheet to a new location in the document or to a different document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id2282479				0	sh	When you copy and paste cells containing \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060102.xhp\"\>date values\</link\> between different spreadsheets, both spreadsheet documents must be set to the same date base. If date bases differ, the displayed date values will change!				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163710				0	sh	To Document				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_MOVETAB:LB_DEST\"\>Indicates where the current sheet is to be moved or copied to.\</ahelp\> Select \<emph\>new document\</emph\> if you want to create a new location for the sheet to be moved or copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154012				0	sh	Insert Before				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145366				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_MOVETAB:LB_INSERT\"\>The current sheet is moved or copied in front of the selected sheet.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>move to end position\</emph\> option places the current sheet at the end.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153726				0	sh	Copy				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_MOVETAB:BTN_COPY\"\>Specifies that the sheet is to be copied. If the option is unmarked, the sheet is moved.\</ahelp\> Moving sheets is the default.				20181231 09:50:43
