helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153929				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_NAVIPI_DOC\"\>Displays the names of all open documents.\</ahelp\> To switch to another open document in the Navigator, click the document name. The status (active, inactive) of the document is shown in brackets after the name. You can switch the active document in the \<emph\>Window\</emph\> menu.				20181231 09:50:43
