helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_SPEC_FILTER:BTN_CASE\"\>Distinguishes between uppercase and lowercase letters when filtering the data.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
