helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153708	29			0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_AUTOFMT_NAME\"\>Enter a name and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. \</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
