helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	sh	\<variable id=\"tabelleeinfuegentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Insert\"\>Defines the options to be used to insert a new sheet.\</ahelp\> You can create a new sheet, or insert an existing sheet from a file.\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154684				0	sh	Position				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	sh	Specifies where the new sheet is to be inserted into your document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154123				0	sh	Before current sheet				20181231 09:50:43
