helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155336				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:MULTILISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_INSERT_TABLE:LB_TABLES\"\>If you selected a file by using the \<emph\>Browse\</emph\> button, the sheets contained in it are displayed in the list box. The file path is displayed below this box. Select the sheet to be inserted from the list box.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
