helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149964				0	sh	Example				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852				0	sh	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISNA(D3)\</item\> returns FALSE as a result.				20181231 09:50:43
