helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3144756				0	sh	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISTEXT(D9)\</item\> returns TRUE if cell D9 contains the text \<item type=\"input\"\>abcdef\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
