helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	sh	You can only turn on the automatic hyphenation in $[officename] Calc when the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05340300.xhp\" name=\"row break\"\>row break\</link\> feature is active.				20181231 09:50:43
