helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148947				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RefreshArrows\"\>Redraws all traces in the sheet. Formulas modified when traces are redrawn are taken into account.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
