helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146986				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_CONSOLIDATE:BTN_REFS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Links the data in the consolidation range to the source data, and automatically updates the results of the consolidation when the source data is changed.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
