helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	sh	If you export a spreadsheet containing multiple operations to Microsoft Excel, the location of the cells containing the formula must be fully defined relative to the data range.				20181231 09:50:43
