helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153366				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>AMORDEGRC function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>depreciations;degressive amortizations\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153366				0	sh	AMORDEGRC				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_AMORDEGRC\"\>Calculates the amount of depreciation for a settlement period as degressive amortization.\</ahelp\> Unlike AMORLINC, a depreciation coefficient that is independent of the depreciable life is used here.				20181231 09:50:43
