helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774	153			0	sh	            \<emph\>Start\</emph\> is the position of the first character in the text to extract.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153063	154			0	sh	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> specifies the number of characters in the part of the text.				20181231 09:50:43
