helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145785				0	sh	Default value				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_COL_OPT:BTN_DEFVAL\"\>Defines the optimal column width in order to display the entire contents of the column.\</ahelp\> The additional spacing for the optimal column width is preset to 0.1 in.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_day.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	DAY 				20181231 09:50:43
