helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	sh	The \<emph\>Sheet Area\</emph\> box on the Formula bar contains a list of defined names for the ranges. Click a name from this box to highlight the corresponding reference on the spreadsheet. Names given formulas or parts of a formula are not listed here.				20181231 09:50:43
