helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153337				0	sh	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149051				0	sh	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20181231 09:50:43
