helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155928				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>STANDARDIZE function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>converting;random variables, into normalized values\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
