helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148772				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageCountField\"\>Inserts as a field the total number of pages in the document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	sh	If you wish to have the page number formatted with a different numbering style, choose \<emph\>Insert - Field - Other\</emph\> to insert the required field, and specify the settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Field\"\>\<emph\>Field\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The format of the field inserted using the \<emph\>Page Number\</emph\> command can also be modified using the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Field\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Field\</emph\>\</link\> command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Print Options				20181231 09:50:43
