helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148856				0	sh	\<variable id=\"nonprintable_text\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/nonprintable_text.xhp\" name=\"Creating Non-printing Text\"\>Creating Non-printing Text\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id4685201				0	sh	To create text that is not to be printed do the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149789				0	sh	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Frame\</item\> and click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150224				0	sh	Enter text in the frame and if you want, resize the frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150242				0	sh	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Frame/Object\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Options\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145227				0	sh	In the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> area, clear the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150320				0	sh	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
