helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155048				0	sh	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variables\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
