helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156252				0	sh	To apply the custom page style to a single page, select the default page style that is used in your document in the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153376				0	sh	To apply the custom page style to more than one page, select its name in the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box. To stop using the style, insert a manual page break and assign it a different page style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154252				0	sh	Use the tabs in the dialog to set the layout options for the page style, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154851				0	sh	To Apply a Page Style				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	sh	Click in the page that you want to apply the page style to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3155888				0	sh	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Style\</item\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	sh	Double-click a name in the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148701				0	sh	To Apply a Page Style to a New Page				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3147122				0	sh	Click in the document where you want a new page to start.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150210				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Manual Break\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150235				0	sh	Select \<emph\>Page break\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150939				0	sh	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box, select the page style that you want to apply to the page that follows the manual break.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150965				0	sh	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Hiding Text				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148856				0	sh	\<bookmark_value\>text; hiding\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sections;hiding\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>paragraphs;hiding\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>hiding;text, with conditions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>variables;for hiding text\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148856	1			0	sh	\<variable id=\"hidden_text\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hidden_text.xhp\" name=\"Hiding Text\"\>Hiding Text\</link\> \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	sh	You can use fields and sections to hide or display text in your document if a condition is met.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409				0	sh	Before you can hide text, you must first create a variable to use in the condition for hiding the text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id5174108				0	sh	To Create a Variable				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153131				0	sh	Click in your document and choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640	21			0	sh	Click the \<emph\>Variables \</emph\>tab and click "Set Variable" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149970	22			0	sh	Click "General" in the \<emph\>Format \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149620				0	sh	Type a name for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149869				0	sh	Enter a value for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Value\</item\> box, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>1\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145108				0	sh	To hide the variable in your document, select \<emph\>Invisible\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149585				0	sh	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156245				0	sh	To Hide Text				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145391				0	sh	Click in the document where you want to add the text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145409	5			0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Functions \</emph\>tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155325	29			0	sh	Click "Hidden Text" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154404				0	sh	Enter a statement in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153371	31			0	sh	Type the text that you want to hide in the \<emph\>Hidden text \</emph\>box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154233				0	sh	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154256				0	sh	To Hide a Paragraph				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	sh	Click in the paragraph where you want to add the text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154872	35			0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Functions \</emph\>tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902	6			0	sh	Click "Hidden Paragraph" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155947				0	sh	Enter a statement in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149991				0	sh	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3793450				0	sh	You must enable this feature by removing the check mark from menu \<emph\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</emph\>. When the check mark is set, you cannot hide any paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148675				0	sh	To Hide a Section				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3148697				0	sh	Select the text that you want to hide in your document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153019				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3148950				0	sh	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide\</item\>, and then enter an expression in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153636				0	sh	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
