helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_tab_innumbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155909				0	sh	To move a numbered or bulleted paragraph down one outline level, click at the beginning of the paragraph, and then press Tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_tab_innumbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155859				0	sh	To move a numbered or bulleted paragraph up one outline level, click at the beginning of the paragraph, and then press Shift+Tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_tab_innumbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153403	8			0	sh	To insert a tab between the number or bullet and the paragraph text, click at the beginning of the paragraph, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab.				20181231 09:50:43
