helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	12			0	sh	Index entries are inserted as fields into your document. To view fields in your document, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View\</item\> and ensure that \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Field Shadings\</item\> is selected. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155507				0	sh	Place the cursor immediately in front of the index entry in your document.				20181231 09:50:43
