helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155893				0	sh	To cycle through the index entries in your document, click the next or the previous arrows in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02160000.xhp\" name=\"Edit Index Entry dialog\"\>\<emph\>Edit Index Entry\</emph\> dialog\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
