helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964				0	sh	Select the paragraph style that you want to include in your table of contents in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150523				0	sh	In the \<emph\>Level\</emph\> list, click the hierarchical level that you want to apply the paragraph style to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153730	17			0	sh	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. You can now apply the style to headings in your document and include them in your table of contents. 				20181231 09:50:43
