helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154897				0	sh	\<variable id=\"navigator\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/navigator.xhp\" name=\"Navigator for Text Documents\"\>Navigator for Text Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402				0	sh	The Navigator displays the different parts of your document, such as headings, tables, frames, objects, or hyperlinks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3154247				0	sh	To open the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, press F5.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155878				0	sh	To quickly jump to a location in your document, double-click an item listed in the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> window or enter the respective page number in the spin box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3147108				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
