helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159260				0	sh	\<variable id=\"text_nav_keyb\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_nav_keyb.xhp\" name=\"Navigating and Selecting With the Keyboard\"\>Navigating and Selecting With the Keyboard\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3155179				0	sh	You can navigate through a document and make selections with the keyboard.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id1031200810571916				0	sh	To move the cursor, press the key or key combination given in the following table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id1031200810571929				0	sh	To select the characters under the moving cursor, additionally hold down the Shift key when you move the cursor.				20181231 09:50:43
