helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3153418				0	sh	Moves the cursor one word to the left or to the right.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3149629				0	sh	Up, down arrow keys				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3149949				0	sh	Moves the cursor up or down one line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3149972				0	sh	(\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>) Moves the current paragraph up or down.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3149624				0	sh	Home				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3149871				0	sh	Moves the cursor to the beginning of the current line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3145108				0	sh	Moves the cursor to the beginning of the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3149586				0	sh	Home				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3156237				0	sh	In a table				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3156260				0	sh	Moves the cursor to the beginning of the contents in the current cell.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3145409				0	sh	Moves the cursor to the beginning of the contents of the current cell. Press again to move the cursor to the first cell in the table. Press again to move the cursor to the beginning of the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3154410				0	sh	End				20181231 09:50:43
