helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3147128				0	sh	To add a border or a shadow to the header or the footer, click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>More\</item\>. The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Border/Background\</item\> dialog opens.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150520				0	sh	To add a separator line between the header or the footer and the content of the page, click the bottom edge of the square in the \<emph\>Line arrangement\</emph\> area. Click a line style in the \<emph\>Style\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3153742	25			0	sh	To adjust the spacing between the content of the header or footer and the line, clear the \<emph\>Synchronize\</emph\> box, and then enter a value in the\<emph\> Bottom\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
