helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D1				0	sh	If you want to count only some text of your document, select the text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id3149821				0	sh	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Word Count\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	hd_id1116200901133957				0	sh	How does %PRODUCTNAME count words?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id1116200901133998				0	sh	In general, every string of characters between two spaces is a word. Tabs, line breaks, and paragraph breaks are word limits, too.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id1116200901133985				0	sh	Words with dashes or always visible hyphens, as in plug-in, add-on, user/config, are counted as one word each.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id111620090113399				0	sh	The words can be a mix of letters, numbers, and special characters. So the following text counts as four words: abc123 1.23 "$" http://www.example.com.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E2				0	sh	To get some more statistics about the document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties - Statistics\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
