helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154270				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_SORTING:RB_UP3\"\>Sorts in ascending order, (for example, 1, 2, 3 or a, b, c).\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150708				0	sh	Descending				20181231 09:50:43
