helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FF				0	sh	Printing a form letter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10803				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>When you print a document that contains database fields, a dialog asks you if you want to print a form letter. If you answer Yes, the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/01150000.xhp\"\>Mail Merge\</link\> dialog opens where you can select the database records to print.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10812				0	sh	Do not show warning again				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10816				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Suppresses this dialog from now on. There is no easy way to get it back!\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
