helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151172	6			0	sh	Character Styles 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	sh	Use Character Styles to format single characters, or entire words and phrases. If you want, you can nest Character Styles.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150713	8			0	sh	Paragraph Styles 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	sh	Use Paragraph Styles to format paragraphs, including the font type and size. You can also select the paragraph style to apply to the next paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
