helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147527				0	sh	Use Frame Styles to format text and graphic frames.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	12			0	sh	Page Styles 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155897				0	sh	Use Page Styles to organize the structure of the document, and to add page numbers. You can also specify the page style to apply to the first page that follows after a page break.				20181231 09:50:43
