helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156058				0	sh	Frames allow you to link certain events to a function that then decides if the event is handled by $[officename] Writer or by the function. See the $[officename] Basic Help for more information.				20181231 09:50:43
