helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145822				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Protect\"\>Prevents the contents of the selected cells from being modified.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154641				0	sh	When the cursor is in a read-only cell, a note appears on the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292				0	sh	To remove cell protection, select the cell(s), right-click, and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05100400.xhp\" name=\"Cell - Unprotect\"\>\<emph\>Cell - Unprotect\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Edit Sections				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153673				0	sh	Edit Sections				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	sh	\<variable id=\"bereichetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditRegion\"\>Changes the properties of sections defined in your document.\</ahelp\> To insert a section, select text or click in your document, and then choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143275				0	sh	The \<emph\>Edit Sections\</emph\> dialog is similar to the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020100.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Section\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, and offers the following additional options:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149820				0	sh	Section				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149104	5			0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Type the name of the section that you want to edit, or click a name in the \<emph\>Section \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\> If the cursor is currently in a section, the section name is displayed on the right side of the status bar at the bottom of the document window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	sh	The current write protection status of a section is indicated by the lock symbol in front of the section name in the list. An open lock is unprotected and a closed lock is protected. Similarly, visible sections are indicated by a glasses symbol.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153638				0	sh	Options				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040501.xhp\" name=\"Options\"\>\<emph\>Options\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, where you can edit the column layout, background, footnote and endnote behavior of the selected section.\</ahelp\> If the section is password protected, you must enter the password first.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155143				0	sh	Remove				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145413				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:MD_EDIT_REGION:CB_DISMISS\"\>Removes the selected section from the document, and inserts the contents of the section into the document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	Ruler				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149287				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03050000.xhp\" name=\"Ruler\"\>Ruler\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147514				0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Ruler\"\>Shows or hides the horizontal ruler, that you can use to adjust page margins, tab stops, indents, borders, table cells, and to arrange objects on the page.\</ahelp\> To show the vertical ruler, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Writer - View\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</link\>\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Vertical ruler\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Ruler\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	sh	\<embedvar href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp#ruler\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sh	While  Typing				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147436	1			0	sh	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150100.xhp\" name=\"While  Typing\"\>While Typing\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017	2			0	sh	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OnlineAutoFormat\"\>Automatically formats the document while you type. To set the formatting options, choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>\<emph\> Options\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Options \</emph\>tab.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	sh	You can use AutoCorrect to format text documents and plain ASCII text files, but not characters that you have manually formatted. Automatic \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040100.xhp\" name=\"word completion\"\>word completion\</link\> only occurs after you type a word for the second time in a document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147407				0	sh	To reverse the last AutoCorrect action, choose \<emph\>Edit - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02010000.xhp\" name=\"Undo\"\>\<emph\>Undo\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536				0	sh	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150200.xhp\" name=\"Other AutoFormat rules\"\>Other AutoCorrect rules\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
