helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147511				0	sh	To specify which nonprinting characters are displayed, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Writer - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\>, and then select the options that you want in the \<emph\>Display of\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
